# Traccar 6 for Home Assistant

![Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/version-{{ version }}-blue.svg)

Unofficial Home Assistant app based on the original Home Assistant Community
Traccar add-on. It runs the current stable Traccar 6 server on `amd64` and
`aarch64` systems.

![Traccar in the Home Assistant frontend](https://github.com/RadMie/addon-traccar/raw/main/images/screenshot.png)

## Installation

Add the following repository to Home Assistant:

```text
https://github.com/RadMie/addon-traccar
```

Read the full documentation and backup the database before upgrading from the
Community Traccar 5 app:

<https://github.com/RadMie/addon-traccar/blob/main/traccar/DOCS.md>

Traccar: <https://www.traccar.org>
